1
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:15,673
Lure it to the village.

2
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:17,348
That's how we get the boss.

3
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:20,460
Wait, you can't be serious.

4
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,917
If we do, the boss will
go after the villagers.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:23,957
Yes, that's the idea.

6
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:27,820
And while the boss is busy
killing NPCs, we can attack it.

7
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:28,877
And kill it.

8
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:30,666
But they're not just objects.

9
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:33,237
NPCs are different than rocks and trees.

10
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:34,150
Look, they're...

11
00:00:34,233 --> 00:00:35,197
Do you think they're alive?

12
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:36,110
Really?

13
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:39,800
In this game, they are just objects.

14
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:43,492
And unlike us, if they're
killed, they can always respawn.

15
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:46,880
Sorry, but I'm not cool with that plan.

16
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:50,320
I'm running this operation, okay?

17
00:00:50,740 --> 00:00:55,137
In case you forgot, I'm still second in
command of the Knights of the Blood Oath.

18
00:00:55,220 --> 00:00:57,780
You'll obey my orders, like it or not.

19
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:09,980
Hey, what's with you guys? Huh?

20
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:12,565
You and the second in command.

21
00:01:12,660 --> 00:01:15,197
You're always getting into
it, and not in the good way.

22
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:17,515
I guess we just don't click, eh, Giel?

23
00:01:18,060 --> 00:01:20,472
You can become powerful here on your own,

24
00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:24,317
but if the day comes when someone you
trust invites you to join a guild?

25
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:25,518
don't turn it down.

26
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:27,317
Well, she took my advice,

27
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:31,459
But who knew she'd join the top
guild and be a floor-clearing badass?

28
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:54,340
I want to always be with you.

29
00:02:54,460 --> 00:02:57,140
I'll give you everything I have.

30
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:20,560
What are you doing?

31
00:03:26,860 --> 00:03:28,680
Oh, hey. What's up?

32
00:03:29,100 --> 00:03:32,637
Everyone in the assault team's working
their butts off to clear the dungeon.

33
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:34,132
And where do I find you?

34
00:03:34,260 --> 00:03:35,700
Out here, taking a nap.

35
00:03:36,160 --> 00:03:38,757
Even if you're a solo player,
you should take this more time.

36
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:41,637
I bet you didn't know this
is Aincrad's nicest season.

37
00:03:41,720 --> 00:03:44,017
Today's weather is at its optimal setting.

38
00:03:44,100 --> 00:03:44,930
Huh?

39
00:03:45,013 --> 00:03:48,253
It'd be a waste to have to go
to work on a day like this.

40
00:03:48,440 --> 00:03:49,270
Whatever.

41
00:03:49,353 --> 00:03:50,320
I can't believe you.

42
00:03:50,540 --> 00:03:52,737
Do you even understand what's going on?

43
00:03:52,820 --> 00:03:55,777
Every day here is another
one lost in the real world.

44
00:03:55,860 --> 00:03:58,817
Yeah, but right now, we're
not in the real world, are we?

45
00:03:58,900 --> 00:04:00,300
We're alive in Aincrad.

46
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:05,110
See?

47
00:04:05,340 --> 00:04:06,877
Doesn't that breeze feel good?

48
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:08,340
And the sun.

49
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:09,780
Oh, come on.

50
00:04:10,060 --> 00:04:12,119
The weather's always the same here.

51
00:04:13,180 --> 00:04:17,004
If you laid down on the grass for
a little bit, you'd understand.

52
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:59,781
Oh, damn, would you look at that.

53
00:05:00,200 --> 00:05:02,197
Taking a nap in the middle of the day.

54
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:03,657
Some people sure got it easy.

55
00:05:03,740 --> 00:05:05,760
Couple of lazy losers, man.

56
00:05:07,220 --> 00:05:09,740
I can't believe she fell asleep.

57
00:05:20,300 --> 00:05:21,260
It's here.

58
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:42,300
Good morning.

59
00:05:42,660 --> 00:05:44,100
You slept like a rock.

60
00:05:53,840 --> 00:05:56,640
You get one meal. Huh?

61
00:05:58,040 --> 00:05:58,870
One meal.

62
00:05:58,953 --> 00:06:00,600
All you can eat, my treat.

63
00:06:01,080 --> 00:06:02,780
Then we'll be even. Deal?

64
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:18,977
that's asuna from the knights of the
blood oath really yeah they call her

65
00:06:19,060 --> 00:06:24,617
the lightning flash who's the shady
looking guy dressed in black well anyway

66
00:06:24,700 --> 00:06:29,757
thank you for today why for keeping

67
00:06:29,840 --> 00:06:33,517
an eye on me oh sure the towns are

68
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:38,017
supposed to be safe zones and unless
you've agreed to a duel a player can't

69
00:06:38,100 --> 00:06:43,897
attack or kill you but when you're
asleep you're vulnerable yeah now

70
