take.

74
00:06:58,253 --> 00:07:00,357
All a sleepy care has
to do is manipulate a

75
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:02,857
sleeping player's finger
to click the OK button.

76
00:07:02,940 --> 00:07:07,480
The duel begins like normal, but the
sleepy care is doing all the attacking.

77
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:09,120
God knows how many

78
00:07:11,620 --> 00:07:12,450
times it's happened.

79
00:07:12,533 --> 00:07:15,237
So, anyway, thank you.

80
00:07:15,320 --> 00:07:16,560
Sure, anytime.

81
00:07:17,060 --> 00:07:18,940
Well, you'd do the same for me.

82
00:07:39,380 --> 00:07:40,660
Hurry, pull it out!

83
00:07:48,900 --> 00:07:50,697
I'll cut him down, you catch him.

84
00:07:50,780 --> 00:07:51,610
Got it.

85
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:53,659
Help's on the way!

86
00:07:56,880 --> 00:07:57,710
Damn it!

87
00:08:12,740 --> 00:08:17,269
The only way he could have died in a
safe zone is if he was beaten in a duel.

88
00:08:18,300 --> 00:08:19,177
That means...

89
00:08:19,260 --> 00:08:22,260
Everyone, look for the
player with the winner icon!

90
00:08:24,100 --> 00:08:25,137
There's no one here!

91
00:08:25,220 --> 00:08:26,220
The room's empty!

92
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:42,697
So any idea how this could have happened?

93
00:08:42,780 --> 00:08:44,721
Well, there's always the obvious.

94
00:08:44,880 --> 00:08:48,597
There was a duel and the other guy
impaled the victim with that spear.

95
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:52,337
Then he put a noose around his
neck and pushed him out the window.

96
00:08:52,420 --> 00:08:54,057
Wouldn't you say that's about right?

97
00:08:54,140 --> 00:08:57,037
Yeah, but I couldn't see
the winner icon on anyone.

98
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,296
It had to be a duel.

99
00:08:58,520 --> 00:09:00,579
It's a safe zone and a player died.

100
00:09:00,940 --> 00:09:03,469
A duel's the only thing
it could have been.

101
00:09:08,220 --> 00:09:09,280
Or maybe not.

102
00:09:10,060 --> 00:09:12,620
Either way, we can't ignore this. I know.

103
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:16,337
As it is, a player takes huge
risks going outside a safe zone.

104
00:09:16,420 --> 00:09:18,891
But if someone's found a way to PK inside,

105
00:09:19,180 --> 00:09:22,337
No one's going to be safe
in the towns either, yeah?

106
00:09:22,420 --> 00:09:24,557
You're right, I guess we.

107
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:26,677
Won't be going back to the
front lines anytime soon.

108
00:09:26,760 --> 00:09:33,517
Listen, you're going to work with
me until we solve this thing.

109
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:36,597
Until we do, there won't
be any time for napping.

110
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:39,680
Okay, okay, but you're
the one who is napping!

111
00:09:53,020 --> 00:09:53,920
Listen up!

112
00:09:54,140 --> 00:09:56,997
Did anyone see what happened
before that player died?

113
00:09:57,080 --> 00:09:58,962
If someone did, please speak up.

114
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:06,470
Sorry.

115
00:10:06,560 --> 00:10:08,736
I can imagine how frightened you are.

116
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:10,727
Could you tell us your name?

117
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:12,550
Sure.

118
00:10:12,740 --> 00:10:14,000
My name is Yoroko.

119
00:10:14,620 --> 00:10:15,640
Was that you?

120
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:18,235
I mean, were you the one who screamed?

121
00:10:18,740 --> 00:10:19,570
Uh-huh.

122
00:10:19,653 --> 00:10:20,640
I knew him.

123
00:10:20,900 --> 00:10:24,997
His name was Caynz and the two of
us used to belong to the same guild.

124
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:27,420
Anyway, we came here together today.

125
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:30,685
We were going to have
dinner somewhere in town.

126
00:10:30,960 --> 00:10:33,080
But we got separated in the plaza.

127
00:10:33,740 --> 00:10:35,240
I looked around for him.

128
00:10:35,580 --> 00:10:39,100
Then I saw him hanging
from that balcony and...

129
00:10:41,500 --> 00:10:43,700
Was there anyone else up there?

130
00:10:44,940 --> 00:10:46,160
For a second there,

131
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:51,060
I'm not sure, but I think I did
see someone standing behind Caynz.

132
00:10:52,220 --> 00:10:54,760
And this person, had you seen them before?

133
00:10:58,360 --> 00:11:02,660
Um, I know this is hard for you,
but think back and try to remember.

134
00:11:03,260 --> 00:11:06,731
Could there be someone, anyone
with the reason to kill him?

135
00:11:19,220 --> 00:11:20,985
Thank you for walking me back.

136
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:22,937
Sorry if it's out of your way.

137
00:11:23,020 --> 00:11:23,850
No worries.

138
00:11:23,940 --> 00:11:27,677
But we'd like to talk to you again
tomorrow, if you're feeling up to it.

139
00:11:27,760 --> 00:11:28,590
Okay.

140
00:11:33,780 --> 00:11:35,360
So, what do we do?

141
00:11:36,040 --> 00:11:36,870
Simple.

142
00:11:36,953 --> 00:11:39,035
We follow the only solid clue we have.

143
00:11:39,520 --> 00:11:42,017
If we can find out where
that spear came from,

144
00:11:42,100 --> 00:11:44,377
it might lead us straight to the killer.

145
00:11:44,460 --> 00:11:47,277
We'll need to find someone
with an appraisal skill.

146
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:51,280
I mean, it's pretty obvious you
don't have one. No, I don't.

147
00:11:51,380 --> 00:11:52,498
And neither do you.

148
00:11:52,700 --> 00:11:56,759
Oh, and by the way, try not to be
so rude when you're speaking to me.

149
00:11:57,020 --> 00:11:58,420
Oh, okay.

150
00:11:58,740 --> 00:11:59,657
Should I call you Ms.

151
00:11:59,740 --> 00:12:00,570
next time?

152
00:12:02,420 --> 00:12:03,479
Second in command?

153
00:12:04,660 --> 00:12:05,601
Lightning flash?

154
00:12:08,380 --> 00:12:14,137
oh never mind call me Asuna
okay sure back to the appraisal

155
00:12:14,220 --> 00:12:18,697
skill though do you know anyone
who has it hmm I've got a friend

156
